    "description": "Here at ZAFELOUS, we treat pets as full family members and strive to develop innovative, reasonably priced pet care supplies that are meant to make owners’ jobs easier, while not interfering with pet safety or comfort. We make sure to employ thoroughly tested, natural active ingredients and carefully selected manufacturers, in order to meet all international standards. Not entirely happy with what you received? Tell us all about it and our customer care department will quickly address the situation! Adjustable Length Dog Flea and Tick Collar for Uninterrupted Long-Lasting Protection The ZAFELOUS flea and tick prevention for dogs enjoys an upgraded slow-release system that prologs its effects, improving protection by stopping the tick from biting instead of acting after the actual bite, thus minimizing risks for your dog’s wellbeing! Featuring an adjustable easy to cut design, with no weird smells or uncomfortable irritating texture, this dog flea collar will certainly become your no. 1 helper when combatting such problems! Not entirely convinced? Here are some of the amazing features of this flea collar: Suitable for all dog sizes and breeds, from small, medium, large; Adjustable size with easy to cut design; Slow release system of active ingredients; Waterproof and bath friendly; Protects against ticks, chewing lice, adult fleas, eggs; Original gift choice for pet owners. Make sure your beloved furry friend enjoys excellent care all year round with this practical tick and flea control for dogs!"
